WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.835
♪♪

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:03.712
Whoa!

00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:05.172
Mega city.

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:06.298
 ♪♪

00:00:06.298 --> 00:00:07.716
This is the place.

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:08.717
(Doorbell rings)

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:09.718
Delivery from re-bot.

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:10.719
Yes!

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:12.721
It's here. Thank you mister.

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:15.724
Hey, are you a boy, or a robot?

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.976
Both. I'm a boy-robot.

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:19.186
Whoa. Wanna play?

00:00:19.186 --> 00:00:20.187
Yes, please.

00:00:20.187 --> 00:00:21.605
3-2-1!

00:00:21.605 --> 00:00:23.065
Why do people play games?

00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:24.942
We play games 'cause it's fun.

00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:27.986
♪♪

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:29.404
Fun? Never heard of it.

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:32.574
You've never heard of fun?

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:35.744
Oh wow, oh boy, oh man, oh
dear, oh wow!

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:36.787
I'll show ya.

00:00:36.787 --> 00:00:38.789
♪♪

00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:42.334
If robots want to know
something, we just plug in
and find out.

00:00:42.334 --> 00:00:45.629
♪♪

00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:47.297
Sure you can plug in...

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:50.133
...But there are some things you
can only learn by doing.

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:52.719
♪♪

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:53.720
Look...

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.514
...with your imagination.

00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:58.767
♪♪

00:00:58.767 --> 00:01:00.477
I don't think I have that app.

00:01:00.477 --> 00:01:01.520
How do I download it?

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:02.562
(Giggles)

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:03.814
♪♪

00:01:03.814 --> 00:01:04.815
Oh yeah!

00:01:04.815 --> 00:01:07.025
♪♪

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:08.443
You brilliant bot!

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:09.444
Woohoo!

00:01:09.444 --> 00:01:16.034
♪♪

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:18.328
Unplug and follow me.

00:01:18.328 --> 00:01:19.329
Woohoo!

00:01:19.329 --> 00:01:21.581
♪♪

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:22.582
Wait!

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:25.669
How could you not tell me you
had a jetpack?

00:01:25.669 --> 00:01:28.171
We're totally playing with that
next time.

